A||||17||gtsonly||2001 Cape Cod show?||||5||
Z||000000||gtsonly||11-21-2000||01:56 PM||||Hey all,<BR>   I am just doing some early planning about a possible June, July 2001 Fiero show here on Cape Cod. I have been to many shows in the past and I hear the same thing over and over, " Let's have a show not to celebrate how our cars look but how they RUN!!!!" I have an idea about doing an AUTOCROSS day here which would entail running a timed course and see who's got it at the wheel. followed by a dinner or some type of awards.<BR>This will take a whole lot of planning so I am trying to get some feed back from you all and who might enjoy a show like this and if you do would you travel to the cape for it. Like i said, i am planning on june or july and also make it a saturday to allow anyone traveling the chance to enjoy the cape for a weekend. This is nothing more than a thought but can become reality very fast if we get enough people. All you who talk of your fast cars and kills, Lets see what you got!!!!<BR>please feel free to post here or email me at candchatch@netzero.net. I have talked to NEFA and it sounds like they like the idea, so come one and all, from anywhere!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||5
Z||000001||TheFiero64||11-21-2000||05:00 PM||||You can count me in. I will help you plan. I know Eric will go too. I can't wait for spring. Here are some pics of the show you got 2nd in last year <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1249362&a=9233502" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1249362&a=9233502</A> <P>------------------<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||1
