Z||000003||Boomtastic||11-22-2000||05:05 AM||||When Chris approached me with the idea, I liked it immediately, and the funnier thing was that not 2 days prior I was discussing this with Ray. We'll work out the details and put something together IF you guys are serious! We're going to need quite a few Fieros to make it an all-day, Fiero only event. Otherwise, we'll end up mixed in with the "pros" and won't get the track all to ourselves. Watch for more details to come after this weekend. I'll post both here and to the lists.||||reg||12
