Z||000012||Cheever2||11-24-2000||01:11 AM||||Yo, Sqoach! <BR>If San Antonio isn't too far, there's the Fiero Roundup V, April 7-8.  For info: <A HREF="http://users.ev1.net/~whitehouse1/" TARGET=_blank>http://users.ev1.net/~whitehouse1/</A> <P>Sometime in May at Norman OK is the S.W.Regional Fiero Fest.  Info: <A HREF="http://www.fco.org/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fco.org/index.html</A> <P>Otherwise, June 8-10, Dallas hosts the Pontiac Southern Nationals.  I heard there were only 3 Fieros there last year.  Info: <A HREF="http://www.dapa.org" TARGET=_blank>www.dapa.org</A> <P>Contact your favorite club for others.<BR>Yer welcome.<BR>||||reg||1
