Z||000015||Old Lar||11-26-2000||11:38 AM||||June is a busy month for Fiero shows.  The Dells is the first weekend in June, Michigan is the third weekend in June.  FOCONE usually has a show in Old Orchard Beach Maine also in June.  You may want to connect with Bob Schlag, Ray Paulk, Tim Perrigo to coordinate all the various shows. I haven't been to the Cape in years and it would be a nice scenic trip.||||reg||3
Z||000016||gtsonly||11-27-2000||11:02 AM||||when is good a good time? Does not have to be in june. I am looking for summer time. July is also an option. Let me know what you all think!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||1
Z||000017||Old Lar||11-27-2000||12:25 PM||||July doesn't have many east coast shows, but I expect that the cape is busy in July, so finding a location may be difficult   Finding a host hotel that is affordable may be difficult.<P>First week in August is the FOCOA show in Williamsburg.  August the cape is busy.  The concern is the same as above.<P>A hard trick to have a show that is in a nice location at a nice time of year and is affordable, with few conflicts with other shows.||||reg||1
